window.products.push({"id":782097,"name":"Multi-Function Manual Food Processors & Chopper with Cover and Handle, Garlic Press Vegetable Chopper Shredder,Suitable for Onions Garlic Carrots Ging","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vmTjVh8HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Strong and Durable]: This mini food processors is made of food-grade PP plastic, which can safely produce a variety of food for your family. The blade is made of stainless steel which can even make the minced meat easily, and the overall structure is very strong. [Operation Steps]: 1. Cut the food into small pieces then put it in the box; 2. Close and tighten the lid towards the left ; 3. Pull the handle several times to chop the food; 4.Pour out the chopped food from the food chopper and put it into the bowl. This vegetable chopper is suitable for cutting celery, ginger, carrots, tomatoes, onions, garlic, peppers, fruits and meat, etc. [Design Details]: This food chopper adopts an ergonomic design. You can press the body of the chopper with one hand and pull the pull-tab with the other hand to ensure not shake while using. The capacity is 500ml, which can meet the needs of processing different food at the same time. The weight of the product is only 210g, which is very light,It is easy to carry and you can store it in anywhere. The pull-tab design of the handle prevents slipping during use. [Easy to Clean]:The blade, cover and bottom body of this vegetable cutter are detachable for easy cleaning,It can be rinsed under running water, but it cannot be rinsed in a dishwasher, moreover,in order to avoid residual food residue becoming hardened, it is recommended to rinse with water after using directly. [Suitable for Kitchen]: This highly efficient and multifunctional vegetable cutter is not only suitable for home kitchens, but also for professional kitchens. It can be used to chop vegetables, fruits, meat, etc.It is a good helper for the kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vmTjVh8HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sifenma","source_asin":"B095GVBD5M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095GVBD5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095GVBD5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
