window.products.push({"id":782138,"name":"Mason Jar Bathroom Accessories Lids Set(4pcs) - Jar Not Included - Soap Dispenser,Toothbrush Holder,and Apothecary Storage Jars Lids for Regular Mouth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.07,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aF6W+kqQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Would you like to give your bathroom some unique style?  Choosing the Mason Jar Bathroom Accessories lids Set is something that shouldn't be missing in bathroom kitchen farmhouse décor Package Includes ：4PCS Mason Jar LIDS, one soap dispenser pump,one toothbrush holder lids and two apothecary storage jars lids. The soap dispenser pump is great for liquid soap,dish soap, body wash, shampoos, mouthwash,hand sanitizer, creams, homemade lotions,dishwashing/laundry detergent, perfume blends, sunscreen, aromatherapy, oil storage and more. Use in the kitchen, bathroom, laundry room, beauty salon...  The toothbrush holder lid is great for storing toothbrushes, razors, makeup brushes,razors,flossers and much more!  The apothecary storage jars lids are great for storing cotton balls,qtips,bath scrubs,cotton rounds ,makeup sponges and more Color :Bronze Material :Rust-proof Premium 304 Stainless Steel (the soap dispenser pump NOT). Our mason jar lids are truly rustproof. These lids are constructed from durable stainless steel and will surely withstand the test of time!  These particular mason jar dispenser lids have a luxurious, glossy oil-rubbed finish. These lids will compliment your oil-rubbed bathroom or kitchen faucets beautifully. Please Kindly Note :Jars are not included,the lids Not fits on wide mouth mason jars. These dispenser lids are for regular mouth mason jars (AKA small mouth) These dispenser lids are NOT compatible with large mouth mason jars. Measure the mouth of your mason jar beforehand to make sure that these lids will fit. The diameter of a regular mouth mason jar is about 2.38 inches, and the diameter of a large mouth mason jar is about 3 inches Save the Environment By substituting single-use plastic soap bottles with these dispenser lids on top of a reusable mason jar, you are doing a great service to preserving our beautiful environment!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aF6W+kqQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andrew & Sarah","source_asin":"B0825RSQDV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0825RSQDV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0825RSQDV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
