window.products.push({"id":782255,"name":"Handmade in America Dark Oak Lazy Susan 10 Inch Diameter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41F4CbQyC8L._AC_.jpg","description":"This lazy susan is hand made from Appalachian oak hardwood. It has a clear hand rubbed lacquer finish which brings out the natural color of the wood. It will blend with other darklight color woods or give a nice contrast to darker woods. Our lazy susans are made with quality American made ball bearing units. This size lazy susan can support up to 125 pounds. It measures 10 inches across the diameter. Lazy susans are great for storage and organization. Display spices on a lazy susan in your kitchen, medications in your breakfast nook, and condiments on your dining room table. Your napkins, sugar bowl and salt and pepper shakers will always be within reach on one of our attractive lazy susans. You can showcase a floral arrangement or centerpiece on your lazy susan. This 10 inch oak lazy susan will make a charming gift or lovely addition to your own home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41F4CbQyC8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handmade in America","source_asin":"B0090V2292","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0090V2292","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0090V2292","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":782256,"name":"Arabia Moomin Mug 0.3 L Relaxing Summer 2020","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.17,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iKD84JxaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"New Moomin mug by Arabia, summer 2020 seasonal product, part of the Moomin Relaxing Summer series. The Moomins remind us how to spend a relaxed summer evening by lounging in the garden. The whole family decided to spend the night outdoors: Moomintroll and Snorkmaiden have found a nice, cozy place under a bush and they are tucked under the same blanket, while Moominpappa is in his favorite spot, his comfy hammock. Little My peeks her head out of the teapot, and Moomminmamma, carrying as always, has brought an evening snack to Moomintroll and Snorkmaiden. The pictures are adapted from Tove Jansson's book, Moominvalley Turns Jungle. In the story, Little My finds on the beach a crate full of unknown seeds, which Moominmamma throws out carelessly, but overnight they turn the place into a dense tropical forest. The series contains a mug, a plate and 2 long spoons.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iKD84JxaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arabia","source_asin":"B0853CCSDX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0853CCSDX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0853CCSDX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
