window.products.push({"id":782355,"name":"Tera Mortar and Pestle Set Natural Marble Grinder Spice Herb Grinder Pill Crusher Black 3.9in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DUXiB3N-L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural marble: The mortar and pestle set are made of marble. The inside of the mortar is as rough as the pestle head, which enhances friction and is easy to grind and crush. The long pestle can be gripped more effectively to minimize energy loss. Product size is 3.9in x 2.36in x 2.24in. Unique existence: Due to the change of the natural color of marble, each mortar and pestle is unique, (please allow a slight difference in the color ). The polished surface of the marble crusher on the outer wall is smooth and beautiful, used to decorate the kitchen The counter is a very good choice.The mortar and pestle are hand-grinded and polished, please allow dimensional errors Easy to Clean: Just rinse the pestle and mortar with sponge thoroughly in warm water, and it doesn’t leave any odor behind. Made from pure natural granite, please wash before the first use to remove the granite powder on the surface. Multi-purpose: This heavy-duty marble mortar is very strong,and it can be easily finished by grinding dry or wet ingredients. Mortar and pestle set can be used to make homemade guacamole, pesto, salsa, and can easily mash garlic, pepper, ginger, nuts, herbs or spices, etc. Please rinse the mortar and pestle with clean water before use The product contains: 1x mortar, 1x pestle. If you have any questions during the purchase process or find that the product is injured or lost, please feel free to contact us, we will provide you with satisfactory answers and after-sales treatment","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DUXiB3N-L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tera","source_asin":"B09WMZXTL2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WMZXTL2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WMZXTL2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":782356,"name":"Rock Your Chakra Selenite Slab 4\"-6\" 8-12 Oz Charging Plate Raw Rocks and Minerals Crown Chakra Healing Crystals and Stones","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oBMeOjpgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description I have sourced these selenite slabs from a private mine in Utah that is one of the largest suppliers in the USA of selenite slabs for designer home construction industry. Huge pieces are used for room dividers, doors and other unique custom home treatments.Most of my current stock are \"water clear\" but some are a mix of semi clear and water clear. These are very different shapes from one piece to another. Some are 5 x 6 inches, some are 3 x 6 inches while another is 4 x 4 inches.You will receive one specimen that is between 8 and 12 ounces. These are perfect to use for cleaning your healing crystal being a large flat surface of ultra pure selenite. Healing Properties A protective stone, Selenite shields a person or space from outside influences. Selenite can evoke protection from the angelic realm and also dispels negative energy. The powerful energies of Selenite help one connect with one's guides, guardians, Christ Consciousness and Higher Self. Selenite calms and soothes, bringing a deep peace and sense of tranquility. Use Selenite in a grid around your home or in the corners of a room to create a safe and peaceful space. Meditating with Selenite aids in access to past and future lives. Selenite brings mental clarity, clearing confusion and revealing the bigger picture behind any problem. Mineral Description Selenite is one of the four varieties of the mineral gypsum and is a common, rock-forming mineral, with thick, extensive beds formed by the evaporation of extremely saline waters. Non-toxic to animals as well as people, gypsum is safe to use in housing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oBMeOjpgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rock Your Chakra","source_asin":"B07Z5MZQG7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z5MZQG7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z5MZQG7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
