window.products.push({"id":782508,"name":"Upgrade 2-Pack Shower Caddy with 2 Soap Dishes Stronger Adhesive Capacity Shower Organizer with 12 Hooks No Drilling Shower Shelf Made of 304 Stainles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J7VBx7ViL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💕Waterproof & Rustproof 💕The shower caddy basket are made of 304 stainless steel, waterproof, rust-proof, non-fading ,corrosion protection and durable. Hollow design can help drain and dry quickly, avoiding harmful substances in humid environments. The shower caddy hanging is perfect ideal for kitchen ，bathroom and bedroom.With this shower caddy suction cup , you will have a neat and tidy home environment in the future. 💕Stronger Adhesive & Load-bearing Capacity💕 The strong sealant ensures the strong load-bearing and adhesion of the bathroom shower organizer. It adheres very firmly to the surface of tiles and stone, making the shower organizer hanging very stable. The maximum load-bearing capacity of each adhesive pad is 40 pounds. Put your bathroom or kitchen supplies on the shower storage and the shower organizer suction will still be steady without tilting over 💕Large Capacity and Multiplicity💕Our shower shelf for inside shower with large storage space, holding shampoo , shower gel and other bathroom essentials. Featuring 12 hooks helps you not only store razors but also hang washcloth or bath brush. If you install the adhesive shower shelves for tile walls in the kitchen, can keep all your spicesthe and seasonings,hook can hang spatula, spoon etc.This bathroom organization over toilet can also help you organise your make-up table and bedroom. 💕Tools Free & Wall Friendly💕No-drilling design of shower rack and adhesive pads lets you install and hang up shower storage accessories easily by pasting pads, saving much more time and effort than traditional installation.Two shelves are installed individually and you can decide the height between the shower caddy hanging to place the things within easy reach. It will easily install and removed without any damage to your wall.It is recommended to be pasted on the smooth, flat and dry surface. 💕What Will You Get💕2 x black shower racks for inside shower with hooks , 2 x soap dish holder with hooks, 4x high-strength adhesives. This shower caddy suction cup with hooks can be used in bath, kitchens, living rooms and bedrooms .It will help you organize your daily necessities and keep them tidy and clean at all times. We are committed to providing with high-quality shower rack. If the shower caddy is defective or damaged, If you have any questions or needs, please contact us freely.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J7VBx7ViL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wcxcareyourlife","source_asin":"B09P3M5WF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P3M5WF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P3M5WF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
