window.products.push({"id":782545,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Cappuccino Sugar and Creamer Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/313ENTBP3EL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description 025398430079 Paired with steaming milk and a dash of cinnamon, strong espresso is transformed into a smooth and pleasing beverage that was the inspiration for Cappuccino pattern. Slightly oversized plates and the new, unique shapes of the mug, cereal bowl and serving pieces give it a stylish, updated look. A dinner table basic. Even if you don't use cream or sugar, a serving set like this can be used for gravy and sauces or condiments like grated cheese or chives. Features: -Complements the Holiday Cheer collection -Microwave, freezer, and oven safe -Perfect for entertaining -Many accessories and serving pieces available Specifications: -Material: Stoneware -Cleaning and Care: Dishwasher safe Please Note: This item cannot ship to Alaska, Hawaii, or Puerto Rico. We apologize for the inconvenience. If you would like assistance finding an item that can ship to Alaska, Hawaii, or Puerto Rico, please contact our customer service team. Amazon.com The colors of coffee and frothy milk combine to create a light tan shade, and that's the dominant color in Pfaltzgraff's Cappuccino pattern. Set against the gleaming white of some pieces, the tan has an appealing translucent quality, and ridges encircle the plate rims and bowl and the mug bottoms for textural interest. This sugar and creamer set is all tan, and nicely complements Cappuccino casual dinnerware place settings. Made of durable stoneware, Cappuccino pieces are chip-resistant and oven-, freezer-, microwave-, and dishwasher-safe. This dinnerware carries a three-year warranty against defects, and each piece can be replaced individually. Pfaltzgraff makes Cappuccino available in dinnerware, glassware, and accessories. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/313ENTBP3EL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B000056WZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782545","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000056WZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000056WZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
