window.products.push({"id":782633,"name":"Personal Hanging Neck Fan, Portable Neck Fan, Detachable Hand Free Fan Rechargeable with 3 Level Airflow, LED Screen Display, 4000mah Battery for Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Sz2ip2GAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【360°Flexible Adjustable Direction】: You can easily wear it around your neck to adjust the direction of the fan head with 360°, so you can adjust the mini fan to the most comfortable angle. With the design of double fans, let the wind wrap your face from all angles. Made of Eco-friendly ABS and silicone, this lighter fan can help you feel more comfortable. 【LED Screen Display】: Our personal portable fan adds an LED display to each of two wind heads, allowing you quickly check the battery level and charge in time to avoid running out of electricity; Plus 360° rotating dual-wind head & seven-leaf fan blades design, you can find the most appropriate wind direction and speed to maximize comfort. 【Detachable fan】：This newest neck fan cam be used as not only a hanging neck fan but two small handheld fans. You can share one of both with your companions and enjoy the coolness together during the journey. Mother's Day, Children's Day and Father's Day are coming, and it is a good choice to be a present. 【Long Battery Life】：Unlike other neck fans only have a 1800mAh battery, our upgraded neck fan is equipped with two 2000mAh battery. Great battery capacity can last for 4-15 working hours.The package comes with one USB cable that can charge the two fan heads at the same time, which saves your waiting time. 【3 Level Airflow】: The portable neck hanging fan has 3 wind speed modes to meet your different needs, giving you the most comfortable cool wind you like.. The wind speed level and battery level of Handheld fan will be displayed on the LCD display.It should be attention that better to tie your long hair up when using the fan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Sz2ip2GAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VersionTECH.","source_asin":"B092HDTM4Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092HDTM4Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092HDTM4Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
