window.products.push({"id":782651,"name":"Meat Bone Sawing Machine, 1500W 110V Commercial Electric Frozen Meat Fish Steak Cutting Machine with Waterproof Safety Device","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":494.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v5pDuMemL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description -Suitable for food processing factory, catering industry, canteen,it can cut all kinds of bones, frozen meat, frozen fish and rasorial cutting. -The machine is used for frozen meat cutting and normal temperature meat, but not good for normal temperature non-bone meat. Specification Voltage: 110V Power: 1500W Saw Blade Speed: 15-19 m/s Wheel Dia: 210mm(8.3\") Net Weight: 45kg(99.2lbs) Gross Weight: 53kg(116.8lbs) Cutting Thickness: 10-150mm(0.4\"-5.9\") Workbench Size: 375x 500mm(14.8\"x 19.7\") Product Size: 52x 52x 92cm(20.5\"x 20.5\"x 36.2\") How to Use 1. Open the side door to place the saw blade on the saw wheel and tighten the blade. 2. Adjust the cutting thickness. 3. Place the ingredients on the work table. 4. Turn on the switch and push the safety push plate onto the saw blade to cut. Package Included 1 x Electric Bone Saw Machine 2 x Saw Blades Notes: 1.Please allow the slight color difference caused by the shooting light and 1-3cm error due to manual measurement, and make sure you do not mind before ordering. 2.The food must be pushed with a safety push plate to avoid injury to the hands when cutting. 3.Please place this product out of the reach of children to avoid injury from the sharp saw blade. 4.After cleaning the machine, it is recommended to dry the surface and the saw blade to prolong the service life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v5pDuMemL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WANLECY","source_asin":"B087FY8M8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087FY8M8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087FY8M8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":782652,"name":"Musunny 100pcs Natural Dried Flower Bouquet,17\" Dried Flowers for Decoration,Dried Floral Arrangements for Home Decor Indoor with Pampas(Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xezWYEeKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌿 Decor for All Seasons--The natural dried flowers arrangements with dried pampas grass decor make a sweet statement all year long.The dry flowers for decoration makes them an especially lovely accent for every season. None of the flowers scream “seasonal,” meaning you can keep them in vases as the holidays roll by. 🌿Long Lasting-- Decorating with rustic dried flowers is a lovely way to bring the beauty of nature into your home all year round without water and trim. The home decor dried flowers has made a big come back in recent years as a way to connect with nature. The dried decorative plants are everlasting and will bring joy to interiors month after month without having to be continually refreshed, making them a far more sustainable way of decorating with flowers. 🌿Unique Bouquet--Our natural dried flowers bouquet mixed with 3 varieties of dried plants and grasses in different shapes, sizes, textures, and colors. The dried pampas grass and bunny tails grass are particularly great for floral enthusiasts to setting up your own arrangement space at home. we’ll note that the dried bunches and stems do not disappoint. Whether your style leans subdued, colorful, or a bit boho, there truly are options for everyone. 🌿 Decor for Any Room--Show the floral arrangements for tables in living room or put the dried boho flowers in vase for bedroom,It is also popular with hanging farmhouse dried flowers for wall decor.The bouquets are modern vase decor filler for country vibe room decor in multiple places around the house. 🌿 Crafts & Gifts—The decorative dried flowers are perfect gift for your mom,wife,daughter to show your unique love.Also it is a good idea to cut them as mini dried flowers for crafts making,such as photo frame,flower wreaths. Bouquets coming from Musunny are artful, blending pops of color and neutral fillers seamlessly in a beautiful mess of texture to warm your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xezWYEeKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Musunny","source_asin":"B0BHQSXMGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782652","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHQSXMGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHQSXMGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
