window.products.push({"id":782693,"name":"Laura Ashley 5x7 Silver Bamboo Metal Picture Frame (Vertical) with Pull-Out Easel Stand, Made for Tabletop, Counterspace, Shelf and Desk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vP2ljyw5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This gorgeous Laura Ashley silver bamboo metal frame provides a stylish boost to any interior space that will do more than just display your favorite photos. The understated elegance to these narrow frames is strikingly evident in its simple, yet stunning design. The thin, metal edges to this attractive frame, reflects light in a subtle way that brightens the tiniest of spaces. The feeling created by seeing your memories displayed in classic, yet modern style may fill you with a sense of warmth. This charming addition to your living space will draw attention to the beauty of family photos, and transport you to the moment you captured stunning architecture in your area or on your favorite vacations. Whether this frame is perched on a mantlepiece, used as an attractive accessory on a shelf, or a decorative piece on the corner of a desk, the frame will provide a stylish boost to your favorite living spaces. The sturdy metal easel allows this frame to rest solidly on any countertop. The thin edges of the metallic borders that surround the glass, give both sides of this vertical frame a clean look that really shines. Gazing at the memories preserved in this gorgeous frame may lift your mood while the frame accentuates the décor of your interior spaces. Take the snapshots of your favorite everyday moments, whether it’s the beauty of the world around you, or your child’s laughter, and turn them into timeless treasures. Display cherished birthday and graduation memories at home in these sophisticated looking, decorative frames or use them as chic display frames for wedding receptions. Share the joy these frames bring you with your friends, family, and co-workers, as they make a thoughtful gift for the holidays or any season. [NOTES: (1) This Frame Can Not Be Mounted on a Wall! (2) This Vertical Frame Does Not Stand Horizontally!]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vP2ljyw5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laura Ashley","source_asin":"B0842YPQYL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0842YPQYL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0842YPQYL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
