window.products.push({"id":782705,"name":"Kertnic 4-Tier Shoe Rack Storage Organizer for Entryway, Free Standing Black Shoes Rack and Boots Racks, Versatile Shoe Shelf Stand with Coat Hanging ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JxEoV6LqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multifunctional Freestanding Shoe Rack ➤ This versatile freestanding shoe rack combines the functions of shoes rack, garment rack, closet rack and hat rack. Large capacity shoes organizer can hold 24-30 pairs of shoes, hang 15-20 pieces of clothes, 3-4 bags at the same time. Make your limited space orderly in room. There are removable compartment, which can be inserted and disassembled at will to meet your needs for storing different types of shoes , sneakers, boots, high-heeled shoes, etc. Sturdy & Durable Materials ➤ The large shoe shelf organizer rack applied premium 16mm diameter sturdy metal pipes and pp connectors, the smooth powder-coated surface on pipes is corrosion-resistant and rustproof. Stable structure enables it loads heavier duty and more durable while using. The layer is waterproof, tear resistant and easy to clean. DIY shoe rack is a perfect solution for daily organization, assure your closet, dormitory, garage, entrance away from mess. Work Great as A Portable Closet Rack ➤ This clothes rack offers you various storage area to place your clothes, accessories, shoes, etc. It saves your time on searching around to get what you want. 63 \" long hanging pole is for hanging clothes, coats, skirts, jackets, pants, shirts (note: not too heavy, because it is portable). Easy access in bedroom, cloakroom, clothing store, walk-in closet and more. The clothing hanger can organize your messy items into neat condition with little effort. Free Combination Design ➤ This large shoe rack has enough accessories. You can freely assemble one or more shoe racks to meet the needs of different scenes. Such as removing some layers so that you can place boots or other large items. Shoe rack organizer can be used to store not only shoes, but also clothes, bags, accessories, bedding and liners, cds and dvds, toys, and more. It helps you maximize your vertical space while saving more floor space for other items. Overall size:63''*68''(LxH). Easy Assembly ➤ Package comes with an instruction manual to help you easily and quickly assemble the shoe rack . If you have any questions about the install process of our shoe storage organizer, please contact us any time for free. If you need replacement parts, message us , we will send you the parts for free .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JxEoV6LqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kertnic","source_asin":"B0C73PJDQ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C73PJDQ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C73PJDQ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":782706,"name":"Excellent Islamic Prayer Rug Velvet Mihrab Janamaz Sajjadah Muslim Namaz Seccade Turkish Prayer Rug (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YTTbrzTQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The prayer rug has a very strong symbolic meaning and traditionally taken care of in a holy manner. It is disrespectful for one to place a prayer mat in a dirty location (as Muslims have to be clean to show their respect to God) or throw it around in a disrespectful manner. The prayer mat is traditionally woven with a rectangular design, typically made asymmetrical by the niche at the head end. Within the rectangle one usually finds images of Islamic symbols and architecture. In some cultures decorations not only are important but also have a deep sense of value in the design of the prayer rug.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YTTbrzTQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MKISLA","source_asin":"B077WRXP9X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077WRXP9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077WRXP9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":782707,"name":"HBlife Weighted Blanket 25lbs for Adults, 100% Oeko-Tex Certified Cozy Heavy Blanket Queen Size with Premium Glass Beads, Navy 60X80 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fniifygxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INTIMATE SLEEP COMPANION - Lying under the weighted blanket feels like being hugged. HBlife heavy blanket help ground your body while giving you the feeling of being hugged or cuddled. The blankets would reduce your tossing and turning at least 95%, making you fall asleep faster. INDUSTRY-LEADING CRAFTSMANSHIP - Unique 7-layer construction ensures sleepers experience maximum softness without feeling the beads bulging. The advanced sewing technology and high-quality, durable materials produce the ideal weighted blanket, which provides optimal temperature control and guarantees that the HBlife weighted blankets no longer leak beads. DEEP NATURAL SLEEP - The weight from the blanket provides the right amount of pressure to make you feel sure and reliable, calm your nerves, and induce quiet sleep. HBlife weighted blankets have been producing with premium microfiber polyester, soft touch to comfort you through the night. SWEET REMINDER & GIFT - Based on customer feedback, we recommend that you choose a blanket between 7-12% of your body weight. NOT recommended for pregnant women, children under three, and old people who cannot move the heavy blanket by themselves - A great yet exclusive gift for your friends or families suffering from sleeplessness. WHAT YOU CAN GET - Available in a premium and cozy HBlife weighted blanket. For any question or complaint about our products, customer service is just one email away. We will work hard to put a smile back on your face. Recommend spot or dry cleaning. Air drying is recommended instead of drying. Or you can use a duvet cover to keep your blanket clean easily and protect it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fniifygxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HBlife","source_asin":"B08ZJGCF96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZJGCF96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZJGCF96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
