window.products.push({"id":782902,"name":"Hamilton Beach 04255 TrueAir Plug-Mount Odor Eliminator with Two Bonus Filters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MD39YB97L._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com This little electric air cleaner freshens air in a room and eliminates the need for heavy odor-masking fragrances by drawing in unpleasant odors with a quiet fan and then trapping and neutralizing them in a carbon filter. It's perfect for pet, tobacco, kitchen, bathroom, workshop, and other odors. The cleaner measures 8-1/2 inches high by 6-1/2 inches wide by 3-3/4 inches deep and plugs into a standard 120-volt wall socket. It has an on/off switch with an indicator light that shows when the unit is working. Three all-purpose filters accompany the unit. Each filter lasts about four months, and there's a dial on the cleaner's top that can be set to the month when a new filter will be needed. Hamilton Beach also offers filters specifically designed for tobacco and pet odors. These can be ordered separately, but they're not included with the unit. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MD39YB97L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B00005A459","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782902","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005A459","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005A459","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
