window.products.push({"id":782997,"name":"Vacuum Sealer Machine, Automatic Food Saver Vacuum Sealer ,Dry & Moist Food Modes/Easy to Clean,Include 10 Vacuum Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g+bQCHD-S._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"🥩【8X Longer Food Fresh Time】Vacuum Sealer.Compared with a single-motor sealer machine, our food vacuum sealer machine with dual-pump design boasts more powerful suction, discharging 99.9% air from sous vide bags. Largely extend the freshness of fruits, vegetables, meats, fish, and snacks up to 8X longer time. 68Kpa high power as well as premium heating wire makes a fast sealing within 10 seconds 🥩【ABOUT VACUUM ON OILY & WATERY FOOD】Since the vacuum sealing system is designed for beginners, the main sealed food type is solid dry food. If you want to seal stewed or steamed food, please make sure that there is not too much oil & water on the edge of the bag. After the watery food is vacuum-sealed, water stains will remain in the vacuum chamber inside the fuselage. Please tilt the fuselage to let oil & water flow out of the edges, or use a dry paper towel to wipe off the water stains. 🥩【TOP INDUSTRY INNOVATION DESIGN-TRANSPARENT WINDOW】Want to see how the air is pumped away? This ◁ 2021 ▷ new sealing machine satisfies your curiosity. We made a 10.2 inch * 0.8 inch super large transparent high-strength glass window on the traditional sealed lid, so that every time you can clearly see the edge of the sealed bag into the middle of the vacuum chamber of the machine. Magical and creative design ideas, so that you can enjoy a different pleasure every time you seal food 🥩【Save Space for Kitchen】This vacuum sealer will be a good partner for the refrigerator, after vacuuming, food in the refrigerator can be effectively prevented from dehydration, dry crack, can also save a lot of space for your refrigerator and your kitchen room. And the vacuum sealer itself is also very smart size, it is easy to take 🥩【What You Will Get】 1 x Vacuum Sealer, 10 x Heat-seal bags (6.7\"*9.8\"), 1 x User Manual. Please note: Due to the rules of use of each machine, the operating sequence is different. Found through experiments: 90% of machine damage is caused by incorrect operation, so please read the manual carefully before using the machine. ( Any question please contact us at first time, will actively handle for you, and promise unconditional return and refund) -100% satisfied","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g+bQCHD-S._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RSTLAEQU","source_asin":"B08TWXFZL1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-782997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TWXFZL1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TWXFZL1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
